WEBVTT

00:01.660 --> 00:03.960
<b>August 15, 2009</b>

00:07.950 --> 00:10.210
<b>Miura Florist</b>

00:15.220 --> 00:16.970
<b>Why are you dressed like that?</b>

00:17.050 --> 00:19.010
<b>Isn't there a shrine festival today?</b>

00:19.350 --> 00:20.270
<b>What about you?</b>

00:20.350 --> 00:22.480
<b>I'm a staff member.</b>

00:22.560 --> 00:23.980
<b>It's our family's festival after all.</b>

00:24.060 --> 00:25.600
<b>I have to dress up as the Itsukihime.</b>

00:26.060 --> 00:27.860
<b>Isn't Kaoru going with you?</b>

00:27.940 --> 00:30.440
<b>I remember she said
she would also come to the festival.</b>

00:30.690 --> 00:32.650
<b>I already have an appointment this time.</b>

00:32.740 --> 00:33.950
<b>I see.</b>

00:34.860 --> 00:37.780
<b>By the way, you're quite particular.</b>

00:37.870 --> 00:39.490
<b>You're wearing a yukata.</b>

00:40.200 --> 00:42.540
<b>I'm wearing a simple kimono, not a yukata.</b>

00:42.620 --> 00:44.000
<b>I see.</b>

00:45.000 --> 00:46.290
<b>But…</b>

00:46.380 --> 00:48.000
<b>I did put a lot of thought into it.</b>

00:48.090 --> 00:51.210
<b>After all, it's a promise I made
with an old friend long ago.</b>

00:51.590 --> 00:54.840
<b>Could it be… a girl?</b>

00:54.930 --> 00:56.680
<b>Your guess is spot on.</b>

00:57.390 --> 00:59.010
<b>Is she cute?</b>

00:59.430 --> 01:00.640
<b>Of course.</b>

01:00.720 --> 01:02.930
<b>She's a celestial maiden after all.</b>

01:03.480 --> 01:04.690
<b>Let's leave it at that for now.</b>

01:04.770 --> 01:06.440
<b>I should get going.</b>

01:06.520 --> 01:08.400
<b>Huh? Wait…</b>

01:08.400 --> 01:12.570
<b>Fresh
 Vegetables</b>

01:10.820 --> 01:12.230
<b>Celestial maiden?</b>

01:24.500 --> 01:29.540
<b>Sword of the Demon Hunter</b>

02:43.700 --> 02:47.930
<b>August 8, Meiji 5</b>

02:46.040 --> 02:47.930
<b>Demon Soba</b>

02:47.000 --> 02:47.960
<b>A shrine festival?</b>

02:50.540 --> 02:53.040
<b>Yes, on August 15th,</b>

02:53.130 --> 02:55.750
<b>there will be a lot of stalls
at the Aragi Shrine.</b>

02:55.840 --> 02:58.220
<b>Why don't you go take a look with Nomari?</b>

02:58.300 --> 02:59.970
<b>It's good to relax once in a while.</b>

03:01.550 --> 03:02.550
<b>And?</b>

03:03.600 --> 03:06.560
<b>Talking to you is just so easy.</b>

03:06.640 --> 03:09.520
<b>I just heard an interesting rumor.</b>

03:09.600 --> 03:10.940
<b>You want to hear it, right?</b>

03:12.730 --> 03:15.400
<b>You know the legend
of the feathered robe, right?</b>

03:15.480 --> 03:18.190
<b>At the Aragi Shrine,
where the Sky Fox is worshiped,</b>

03:18.280 --> 03:20.070
<b>a tale of the celestial maiden
is also passed down,</b>

03:20.150 --> 03:23.160
<b>and it differs slightly
from the versions told elsewhere.</b>

03:24.950 --> 03:27.040
<b>In this story, after her feathered robe
was taken from her,</b>

03:27.120 --> 03:30.410
<b>she married a young man
who lived in a sword-forging village.</b>

03:30.500 --> 03:32.580
<b>But in the end, she caught a disease.</b>

03:32.670 --> 03:37.250
<b>So the young man decided to send his wife
back to the heavens with his own hands.</b>

03:37.880 --> 03:42.380
<b>At that time, the young man used a mirror
that could connect heaven and earth.</b>

03:42.470 --> 03:46.600
<b>That iron mirror is said to be
the goshintai now enshrined at Aragi.</b>

03:46.970 --> 03:49.850
<b>A mirror that can send celestial maidens
back to the heavens?</b>

03:50.180 --> 03:52.850
<b>That's the main point.</b>

03:52.940 --> 03:54.690
<b>I heard that last night</b>

03:54.770 --> 03:59.230
<b>a light emanated from the main hall
where the mirror was enshrined.</b>

03:59.320 --> 04:01.860
<b>And according to the man who witnessed it,</b>

04:01.950 --> 04:03.990
<b>he seemed to glimpse a human silhouette.</b>

04:07.240 --> 04:11.080
<b>Isn't this curious tale
right up your alley?</b>

04:11.580 --> 04:14.290
<b>It does sound interesting.</b>

04:15.170 --> 04:18.250
<b>Consider this news
the payment for your meal.</b>

04:19.170 --> 04:20.710
<b>Sorry about that.</b>

04:21.340 --> 04:23.010
<b>A shrine festival…</b>

04:24.340 --> 04:26.970
<b>Sorry to keep you waiting.</b>

04:27.050 --> 04:29.390
<b>I'm the priest of this shrine,</b>

04:29.470 --> 04:31.390
<b>Kodai Kunieda.</b>

04:31.850 --> 04:33.890
<b>I'm Jinya Kadono.</b>

04:33.980 --> 04:37.060
<b>I run a soba restaurant on Sanjo Street.</b>

04:37.150 --> 04:38.610
<b>So, about that rumor…</b>

04:38.690 --> 04:41.150
<b>You mean the iron mirror?</b>

04:43.110 --> 04:46.370
<b>It's not impossible
if you want to inquire more,</b>

04:46.450 --> 04:50.160
<b>but what happened yesterday was just
a thief stealing the offering money.</b>

04:50.240 --> 04:55.000
<b>Some indeed say the iron mirror
can connect heaven and earth.</b>

04:55.080 --> 04:57.790
<b>But a story is just a story.</b>

04:58.340 --> 05:01.260
<b>Things like that
don't come true so easily.</b>

05:01.670 --> 05:04.220
<b>That iron mirror you said…</b>

05:04.300 --> 05:06.430
<b>May I see it?</b>

05:06.590 --> 05:08.510
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

05:08.600 --> 05:12.180
<b>The goshintai
isn't open for public viewing.</b>

05:13.060 --> 05:14.180
<b>I see.</b>

05:15.520 --> 05:16.690
<b>Dear.</b>

05:17.190 --> 05:18.940
<b>Chiyo.</b>

05:19.020 --> 05:21.320
<b>I'm sorry to interrupt your conversation.</b>

05:21.860 --> 05:23.940
<b>But you have a visitor.</b>

05:25.030 --> 05:27.660
<b>Mr. Kadono, I'm really sorry.</b>

05:27.740 --> 05:29.990
<b>I have to excuse myself now.</b>

05:30.330 --> 05:33.200
<b>Don't say that. I'm the one who intruded.</b>

05:43.460 --> 05:44.670
<b>Mr. Jinya.</b>

05:44.760 --> 05:47.090
<b>If you need anything else,
please visit again.</b>

05:47.180 --> 05:48.800
<b>I'll be honored to await your visit.</b>

05:49.390 --> 05:51.140
<b>I appreciate your kindness.</b>

05:51.220 --> 05:53.100
<b>I shall take my leave too.</b>

05:58.600 --> 05:59.810
<b>Invisibility.</b>

06:12.030 --> 06:14.660
<b>Where am I?</b>

06:15.370 --> 06:17.120
<b>Hey, you guys are here, right?</b>

06:17.210 --> 06:19.790
<b>Kadono, Miyaka.</b>

06:19.880 --> 06:22.590
<b>Please, just stop hiding already.</b>

06:29.340 --> 06:31.970
<b>Thank goodness! I knew you'd be here.</b>

06:32.050 --> 06:34.430
<b>I've finally found you.</b>

06:34.890 --> 06:37.560
<b>Uh…</b>

06:38.730 --> 06:40.020
<b>What's going on?</b>

06:40.100 --> 06:42.230
<b>How am I supposed to answer that?</b>

06:42.900 --> 06:45.150
<b>But…</b>

06:45.230 --> 06:46.240
<b>What?</b>

06:46.610 --> 06:47.690
<b>All right.</b>

06:47.780 --> 06:49.820
<b>Let me introduce myself first.</b>

06:49.910 --> 06:51.950
<b>I'm Jinya Kadono.</b>

06:52.370 --> 06:55.330
<b>Huh? Why are we still doing
introductions at this point?</b>

06:58.710 --> 07:01.080
<b>I don't really understand what you mean,
but never mind.</b>

07:01.170 --> 07:03.540
<b>Please allow me
to understand your situation.</b>

07:03.630 --> 07:05.630
<b>Okay… sure.</b>

07:05.710 --> 07:11.180
<b>But before that,
could I ask you something?</b>

07:13.350 --> 07:16.470
<b>Why are you dressed like that?</b>

07:16.560 --> 07:18.480
<b>What's wrong with it?</b>

07:18.560 --> 07:20.060
<b>Well…</b>

07:20.140 --> 07:22.770
<b>I think it suits you quite well.</b>

07:24.110 --> 07:25.610
<b>Could it be…</b>

07:25.690 --> 07:26.530
<b>I've got a question.</b>

07:26.610 --> 07:28.190
<b>Well…</b>

07:28.280 --> 07:30.650
<b>May I know where we are?</b>

07:31.200 --> 07:33.070
<b>This is the Aragi Inari Shrine.</b>

07:33.780 --> 07:35.530
<b>That sounds like the name of a place.</b>

07:35.620 --> 07:38.580
<b>May I know the name of this area?</b>

07:38.910 --> 07:41.250
<b>This is Sanjo Street in Kyoto.</b>

07:41.330 --> 07:42.330
<b>Also,</b>

07:42.420 --> 07:44.790
<b>if speaking formally feels awkward,
don't force yourself.</b>

07:46.800 --> 07:48.460
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:48.550 --> 07:49.920
<b>Kyoto.</b>

07:50.470 --> 07:51.720
<b>I have one more question.</b>

07:51.800 --> 07:53.140
<b>What year is it now?</b>

07:53.590 --> 07:55.800
<b>We're now five years into the Meiji era.</b>

07:57.560 --> 07:59.600
<b>Thank you for telling me.</b>

08:00.140 --> 08:02.390
<b>I kind of get what's going on.</b>

08:03.440 --> 08:06.320
<b>Can't believe I could accept
something so absurd this easily.</b>

08:06.400 --> 08:08.480
<b>I feel a little sad for myself.</b>

08:09.110 --> 08:11.030
<b>Then let me ask you something too.</b>

08:11.110 --> 08:12.570
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

08:12.860 --> 08:13.780
<b>What?</b>

08:13.860 --> 08:15.660
<b>Well…</b>

08:15.740 --> 08:18.660
<b>I only remember a sudden flash of light,
bang, right before me.</b>

08:18.740 --> 08:20.750
<b>When I came to, I was already here.</b>

08:20.830 --> 08:24.540
<b>I also don't know why I ended up here.</b>

08:24.920 --> 08:26.670
<b>Let me ask you anyway.</b>

08:26.750 --> 08:27.750
<b>Where do you live?</b>

08:27.920 --> 08:30.260
<b>I wonder where it is.</b>

08:30.340 --> 08:32.840
<b>I'm also not sure how to get back.</b>

08:40.190 --> 08:42.870
<b>Tofu</b>

08:49.190 --> 08:50.190
<b>The houses are spectacular.</b>

08:50.280 --> 08:51.860
<b>They all feel so retro.</b>

08:51.940 --> 08:53.570
<b>That was a real carriage, right?</b>

08:56.410 --> 08:57.990
<b>So many oil-paper umbrellas!</b>

09:10.210 --> 09:13.380
<b>So you brought her back
to our shop just like that?</b>

09:15.590 --> 09:18.890
<b>Lord Kadono seems
to like bringing women home.</b>

09:19.300 --> 09:23.020
<b>N-Nice to meet you.</b>

09:24.180 --> 09:26.310
<b>Please call me Kaneomi.</b>

09:26.400 --> 09:28.860
<b>Could you tell me your name?</b>

09:28.980 --> 09:32.860
<b>I'm… How should I put it?</b>

09:36.820 --> 09:38.490
<b>She's a celestial maiden.</b>

09:39.370 --> 09:40.370
<b>What?</b>

09:40.700 --> 09:43.040
<b>Uhm…</b>

09:43.120 --> 09:44.540
<b>Kadono?</b>

09:45.080 --> 09:47.170
<b>You don't want to say your name, right?</b>

09:47.790 --> 09:48.880
<b>Yes.</b>

09:48.960 --> 09:51.670
<b>I feel like I'll get in trouble
if I say it out loud.</b>

09:51.750 --> 09:54.550
<b>But calling me "celestial maiden"
outright is a bit too…</b>

09:54.630 --> 09:55.800
<b>In that case,</b>

09:55.880 --> 09:57.590
<b>how about "Asagao"?</b>

09:57.680 --> 09:59.010
<b>Asagao?</b>

09:59.090 --> 10:01.560
<b>Consider it your temporary name
for the time being.</b>

10:03.600 --> 10:06.890
<b>He once said I looked like
a celestial maiden, could it be…</b>

10:06.980 --> 10:08.600
<b>- "Asagao," morning glory…
- This name should be fine, right?</b>

10:08.690 --> 10:09.690
<b>So that's how it is…</b>

10:10.980 --> 10:12.020
<b>It's fine.</b>

10:12.110 --> 10:15.400
<b>If you have nowhere to go,
you can stay here for a while.</b>

10:15.990 --> 10:17.240
<b>Are you sure?</b>

10:17.320 --> 10:18.660
<b>I don't mind.</b>

10:19.410 --> 10:21.370
<b>You have nowhere else to go, right?</b>

10:21.450 --> 10:22.450
<b>Yes.</b>

10:22.870 --> 10:24.620
<b>I'm living under another's roof too,</b>

10:24.700 --> 10:26.540
<b>so I don't really have a choice.</b>

10:26.620 --> 10:28.540
<b>Now that everything's been said,</b>

10:28.620 --> 10:30.670
<b>I'll get going.</b>

10:30.750 --> 10:32.590
<b>I have an appointment.</b>

10:32.840 --> 10:34.420
<b>An appointment?</b>

10:34.510 --> 10:37.510
<b>Yes, a secret rendezvous with a gentleman.</b>

10:41.680 --> 10:43.510
<b>I don't get her at all.</b>

10:44.140 --> 10:47.230
<b>Sorry, I got sidetracked.</b>

10:47.310 --> 10:48.890
<b>So, what are you going to do?</b>

10:48.980 --> 10:50.980
<b>About that…</b>

10:51.690 --> 10:53.650
<b>Is this really okay?</b>

10:53.730 --> 10:55.780
<b>It's a little strange to say it myself,</b>

10:55.860 --> 10:57.690
<b>but I look suspicious
no matter how you look at it.</b>

10:57.950 --> 10:59.320
<b>Don't underestimate me.</b>

11:01.450 --> 11:04.240
<b>Kadono, you're really kind.</b>

11:06.410 --> 11:09.370
<b>Well then, I'll take you up on your offer.</b>

11:09.800 --> 11:13.270
<b>Demon Soba</b>

11:11.040 --> 11:12.210
<b>Well…</b>

11:12.290 --> 11:14.590
<b>Nice to meet you, Nomari.</b>

11:16.090 --> 11:19.130
<b>Uh, I'm Asagao.</b>

11:19.970 --> 11:20.880
<b>Another one?</b>

11:20.970 --> 11:21.970
<b>Nomari.</b>

11:22.720 --> 11:24.180
<b>I'm Nomari.</b>

11:24.560 --> 11:26.680
<b>Sorry, I made the decision on my own.</b>

11:27.350 --> 11:30.190
<b>If that's what you've decided,
I have no objections.</b>

11:32.230 --> 11:33.940
<b>I wouldn't say it makes up for anything,</b>

11:34.020 --> 11:35.900
<b>but would you like
to go out together next time?</b>

11:36.190 --> 11:37.190
<b>Really?</b>

11:37.480 --> 11:39.860
<b>I heard there'll be a festival at Aragi.</b>

11:39.950 --> 11:42.990
<b>Sometimes it's fun to join the fun
and browse the stalls, right?</b>

11:43.320 --> 11:44.990
<b>A festival?</b>

11:45.080 --> 11:46.200
<b>This is a rare opportunity.</b>

11:46.290 --> 11:49.250
<b>Tomorrow, let's go take a look
at the yukata for the festival.</b>

11:50.580 --> 11:51.670
<b>Okay.</b>

11:51.750 --> 11:53.880
<b>Father, it's a promise.</b>

11:54.210 --> 11:56.960
<b>I initially thought
it was a lie or a joke,</b>

11:57.050 --> 12:00.170
<b>but you really are a father.</b>

12:00.800 --> 12:02.970
<b>I told you, didn't I?</b>

12:03.270 --> 12:04.980
<b>Demon Soba</b>

12:17.980 --> 12:19.740
<b>This is…</b>

12:21.780 --> 12:25.740
<b>That's right, I came to the Meiji period.</b>

12:28.240 --> 12:31.750
<b>I met the boy from my class
in the Meiji period.</b>

12:32.250 --> 12:35.880
<b>Who would even believe that?</b>

12:38.550 --> 12:42.800
<b>So it's true that demons
can live for over 100 years.</b>

12:48.260 --> 12:50.180
<b>Good morning, Kadono.</b>

12:50.680 --> 12:51.680
<b>You're awake.</b>

12:52.140 --> 12:55.270
<b>Uh… I want to wash my face.</b>

12:56.100 --> 12:57.770
<b>There's a well in the backyard.</b>

12:57.860 --> 12:58.770
<b>You can use it.</b>

12:58.860 --> 12:59.780
<b>A well?</b>

13:02.860 --> 13:04.030
<b>I have to use a well, yes?</b>

13:07.620 --> 13:09.120
<b>It's not just Kaneomi.</b>

13:09.200 --> 13:11.750
<b>I really don't get young women these days.</b>

13:26.760 --> 13:28.050
<b>Welcome.</b>

13:28.350 --> 13:29.180
<b>Oh?</b>

13:29.260 --> 13:31.470
<b>Did I come to the wrong shop?</b>

13:31.810 --> 13:33.140
<b>You're here, Somegorou.</b>

13:33.230 --> 13:34.060
<b>Mm?</b>

13:34.140 --> 13:35.890
<b>By the way, where is Kaneomi?</b>

13:35.980 --> 13:38.520
<b>I think she's on a secret date with a man.</b>

13:38.610 --> 13:39.650
<b>What would you like to have?</b>

13:39.730 --> 13:41.860
<b>I'll have kitsune soba.</b>

13:42.320 --> 13:43.490
<b>What about you, Heikichi?</b>

13:43.900 --> 13:45.450
<b>I'll have tempura soba.</b>

13:48.990 --> 13:50.530
<b>Here you are. Please enjoy.</b>

13:50.620 --> 13:51.620
<b>Thank you.</b>

13:51.700 --> 13:52.700
<b>Thanks.</b>

13:55.750 --> 13:57.080
<b>It's delicious.</b>

13:57.540 --> 13:58.540
<b>No, wait.</b>

13:58.630 --> 14:01.210
<b>I really need to ask him more about this.</b>

14:01.300 --> 14:02.460
<b>Hey.</b>

14:08.300 --> 14:09.930
<b>So you're a celestial maiden.</b>

14:10.010 --> 14:13.060
<b>The world sure is full of strange things.</b>

14:13.350 --> 14:15.480
<b>I don't think you're
in a position to say that.</b>

14:15.890 --> 14:17.900
<b>You're right.</b>

14:19.190 --> 14:20.940
<b>Uh… is something wrong?</b>

14:21.900 --> 14:25.150
<b>It's just that you're so cute
that I couldn't help but stare at you.</b>

14:25.240 --> 14:28.530
<b>Huh? Oh, thank you very much.</b>

14:29.570 --> 14:31.870
<b>I haven't introduced myself yet.</b>

14:31.950 --> 14:33.990
<b>I'm Somegorou Akitsu,</b>

14:34.080 --> 14:35.830
<b>this person's best friend.</b>

14:35.910 --> 14:37.660
<b>Who said you're my best friend?</b>

14:38.870 --> 14:41.170
<b>You're really shy, huh?</b>

14:46.170 --> 14:49.130
<b>I'm Asagao, pleased to meet you.</b>

14:49.220 --> 14:51.220
<b>Mm, likewise.</b>

14:51.300 --> 14:52.930
<b>Heikichi, say hello too.</b>

14:53.010 --> 14:54.770
<b>She came out of the light?</b>

14:54.850 --> 14:56.060
<b>What nonsense is that?</b>

14:56.140 --> 14:58.060
<b>Don't tell me she's a demon too.</b>

14:58.350 --> 15:01.100
<b>Well, I…</b>

15:02.310 --> 15:03.320
<b>- Hey!
- Ouch!</b>

15:03.400 --> 15:05.570
<b>I'm sorry, Asagao.</b>

15:05.650 --> 15:07.650
<b>He's not very smart.</b>

15:07.740 --> 15:09.950
<b>What are you doing, Master?</b>

15:10.360 --> 15:12.910
<b>If you still don't know why you got hit,</b>

15:12.990 --> 15:14.240
<b>then shut up.</b>

15:16.290 --> 15:18.660
<b>Hey, Mr. Akitsu.</b>

15:18.750 --> 15:21.420
<b>It's okay. I'm not angry.</b>

15:22.500 --> 15:24.670
<b>Asagao, you're such a good girl.</b>

15:24.750 --> 15:30.180
<b>But I'm not angry
because he called you a demon.</b>

15:31.470 --> 15:35.100
<b>Be it a celestial maiden or a demon,
he ought to face it with a smile.</b>

15:35.180 --> 15:37.890
<b>If he doesn't have the capacity
to accept both the good and the bad,</b>

15:37.980 --> 15:39.890
<b>it'll trouble me.</b>

15:39.980 --> 15:41.400
<b>A man like that</b>

15:41.480 --> 15:44.570
<b>can't live up
to the name Somegorou Akitsu.</b>

15:44.650 --> 15:46.440
<b>M-Master.</b>

15:46.530 --> 15:50.110
<b>By the way, you're bursting with energy.</b>

15:50.530 --> 15:51.660
<b>What do you mean?</b>

15:51.740 --> 15:56.080
<b>You have a daughter,
but you still brought two women home.</b>

15:56.160 --> 15:59.250
<b>I have to tell Ofuu about this.</b>

16:01.420 --> 16:04.170
<b>I'm just kidding.</b>

16:04.330 --> 16:06.300
<b>Who is Ms. Ofuu?</b>

16:06.380 --> 16:07.670
<b>She's my benefactor.</b>

16:07.750 --> 16:10.550
<b>She taught me many things.</b>

16:10.630 --> 16:13.970
<b>It's undoubtedly thanks to her
that I'm who I am now.</b>

16:14.050 --> 16:15.140
<b>I see.</b>

16:15.220 --> 16:17.510
<b>Is she someone you used to have
a special relationship with?</b>

16:17.600 --> 16:21.100
<b>No, she's a friend
and like an older sister to me.</b>

16:21.890 --> 16:24.350
<b>Anyway, it's hard to put into words.</b>

16:27.520 --> 16:28.570
<b>What's wrong?</b>

16:28.780 --> 16:31.150
<b>I'm just a bit surprised, that's all.</b>

16:31.240 --> 16:32.990
<b>And you actually have a best friend.</b>

16:33.070 --> 16:35.320
<b>I told you, he's not my best friend.</b>

16:35.410 --> 16:37.370
<b>You're being stubborn again.</b>

16:39.330 --> 16:40.410
<b>I'm home.</b>

16:40.500 --> 16:41.460
<b>You're back, young lady.</b>

16:41.540 --> 16:43.710
<b>Welcome home, Nomari.</b>

16:43.790 --> 16:44.750
<b>Yes.</b>

16:45.920 --> 16:48.630
<b>Father, you remember our promise, right?</b>

16:48.710 --> 16:50.550
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

16:51.090 --> 16:53.430
<b>I've been waiting for you to come home.</b>

16:55.680 --> 16:57.470
<b>I'll get ready now.</b>

16:59.600 --> 17:00.720
<b>Kadono.</b>

17:00.810 --> 17:02.730
<b>I'll take care of the entrance curtains.</b>

17:02.810 --> 17:03.850
<b>But…</b>

17:03.940 --> 17:06.860
<b>It's fine, just go keep her company.</b>

17:06.940 --> 17:08.230
<b>You're the father here.</b>

17:09.190 --> 17:12.690
<b>Didn't they say they just met yesterday?</b>

17:12.780 --> 17:16.410
<b>Why do they look like long-time friends?</b>

17:16.520 --> 17:19.490
<b>Kimono Shop</b>

17:16.520 --> 17:19.490
<b>Kimono</b>

17:24.040 --> 17:25.210
<b>Nomari, what do you want?</b>

17:25.500 --> 17:27.040
<b>You choose for me, Father.</b>

17:27.500 --> 17:28.840
<b>Well then…</b>

17:31.050 --> 17:32.630
<b>Please give me that yukata.</b>

17:32.710 --> 17:34.590
<b>As for the pattern…</b>

17:35.630 --> 17:37.140
<b>Do you have moonflower?</b>

17:37.220 --> 17:38.800
<b>Yes, we do.</b>

17:38.890 --> 17:40.470
<b>Are you sure?</b>

17:40.560 --> 17:41.640
<b>Of course.</b>

17:42.020 --> 17:44.060
<b>Thank you, Mother.</b>

17:44.140 --> 17:45.390
<b>All right.</b>

17:46.650 --> 17:47.980
<b>What is that?</b>

17:48.060 --> 17:50.270
<b>It's a ribbon.</b>

17:50.360 --> 17:54.360
<b>A Western-imported
fabric accessory for tying the hair.</b>

17:54.440 --> 17:57.200
<b>It's not yet widely available
to the general public.</b>

17:57.280 --> 17:59.320
<b>But the ladies
who are sensitive to fashion</b>

17:59.410 --> 18:01.200
<b>have already started
paying attention to it.</b>

18:03.660 --> 18:04.910
<b>If that's the case,</b>

18:05.000 --> 18:06.120
<b>I'll take the ribbon too.</b>

18:07.750 --> 18:10.840
<b>White powder flower…
Looks like you don't have it.</b>

18:11.750 --> 18:13.300
<b>Do you have a cherry blossom-colored one?</b>

18:13.380 --> 18:14.590
<b>Yes, I do.</b>

18:22.680 --> 18:24.350
<b>Hey, Father.</b>

18:25.930 --> 18:28.770
<b>What was my mother like?</b>

18:30.310 --> 18:32.070
<b>How should I put it?</b>

18:36.110 --> 18:39.280
<b>Your mother's name was Yunagi.</b>

18:40.200 --> 18:43.120
<b>Yunagi was someone who loved to tell lies.</b>

18:43.490 --> 18:44.870
<b>Tell lies?</b>

18:45.370 --> 18:49.790
<b>Yes, for example,
Yunagi often said she hated children.</b>

18:51.080 --> 18:52.290
<b>But</b>

18:52.380 --> 18:54.800
<b>when she hugged you,
her hands were gentle beyond compare.</b>

18:56.130 --> 18:57.800
<b>No matter how many lies she told,</b>

18:57.880 --> 19:01.140
<b>her love for you could never be a lie.</b>

19:01.220 --> 19:04.390
<b>That's the kind of clumsy woman she was.</b>

19:05.470 --> 19:08.350
<b>And Nomari refers
to the white powder flower.</b>

19:08.440 --> 19:09.730
<b>Your name</b>

19:09.810 --> 19:12.360
<b>was given following Yunagi's example.</b>

19:14.570 --> 19:16.860
<b>I didn't have a mother,</b>

19:16.940 --> 19:20.360
<b>so I'm not sure what kind of person
really counts as a good mother.</b>

19:21.110 --> 19:25.080
<b>But Yunagi truly loved you deeply.</b>

19:25.740 --> 19:27.330
<b>I suppose a mother</b>

19:27.410 --> 19:29.670
<b>is probably someone like her.</b>

19:30.920 --> 19:32.330
<b>I see.</b>

19:39.010 --> 19:40.760
<b>Father, thank you for telling me.</b>

19:40.840 --> 19:42.760
<b>I'm just a bit curious</b>

19:42.850 --> 19:46.520
<b>what kind of person my birth mother was.</b>

19:46.890 --> 19:48.640
<b>You knew all this time?</b>

19:48.810 --> 19:50.140
<b>I could tell.</b>

19:51.310 --> 19:53.110
<b>It's just as you thought.</b>

19:53.770 --> 19:55.860
<b>I'm not your birth father.</b>

19:56.570 --> 19:58.610
<b>But Father is Father.</b>

19:58.990 --> 20:03.160
<b>I've been wanting to know
about my mother for a long time.</b>

20:03.820 --> 20:05.990
<b>Why am I the only one without a mother?</b>

20:06.080 --> 20:09.080
<b>But it doesn't matter
because I have you, Father.</b>

20:09.160 --> 20:10.750
<b>This is enough for me.</b>

20:10.830 --> 20:14.590
<b>To me, you're my real father.</b>

20:15.210 --> 20:16.460
<b>Nomari.</b>

20:20.840 --> 20:21.930
<b>Let's go home.</b>

20:22.010 --> 20:23.010
<b>Okay.</b>

20:24.220 --> 20:25.510
<b>What's wrong?</b>

20:25.800 --> 20:27.560
<b>Father, I'm telling you.</b>

20:27.640 --> 20:29.980
<b>Just because I asked
doesn't mean I want a mother.</b>

20:30.480 --> 20:32.060
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

20:34.980 --> 20:38.230
<b>I mean Ms. Kaneomi and Ms. Asagao…</b>

20:38.320 --> 20:39.740
<b>Don't worry.</b>

20:40.190 --> 20:41.360
<b>Really?</b>

20:41.450 --> 20:43.070
<b>I don't lie.</b>

20:43.160 --> 20:46.490
<b>Besides,
life is already busy enough as it is.</b>

20:46.580 --> 20:49.080
<b>I have no intention of getting a wife.</b>

20:49.410 --> 20:50.500
<b>I see.</b>

21:01.050 --> 21:04.590
<b>Father, you don't have a mother either?</b>

21:04.680 --> 21:05.800
<b>Yes.</b>

21:05.970 --> 21:06.890
<b>In that case,</b>

21:06.970 --> 21:10.140
<b>I'll be your mother in the future.</b>

21:10.220 --> 21:11.520
<b>What do you mean?</b>

21:12.020 --> 21:15.440
<b>Because you're willing to be my father.</b>

21:15.520 --> 21:18.980
<b>So when I grow up,
I want to be your mother too</b>

21:19.070 --> 21:21.190
<b>and shower you with love.</b>

21:22.530 --> 21:23.780
<b>I see.</b>

21:24.400 --> 21:25.990
<b>Then I'm looking forward to it.</b>

21:26.070 --> 21:27.070
<b>Okay.</b>

21:33.830 --> 21:36.830
<b>Ms. Asagao, we're back.</b>

21:37.580 --> 21:39.630
<b>Oh, welcome… home?</b>

21:39.710 --> 21:41.710
<b>Did you find anything you liked?</b>

21:41.960 --> 21:42.800
<b>Yes.</b>

21:42.880 --> 21:45.340
<b>I'll show you later.</b>

21:47.510 --> 21:49.390
<b>What's the matter with her?</b>

21:49.470 --> 21:50.680
<b>It's nothing.</b>

21:50.760 --> 21:52.470
<b>I guess…</b>

21:52.560 --> 21:53.890
<b>As for tomorrow,</b>

21:54.940 --> 21:56.520
<b>I'm going out.</b>

21:56.600 --> 21:58.060
<b>What's your plan?</b>

21:58.150 --> 21:59.940
<b>Huh? Where are you going?</b>

22:00.190 --> 22:01.690
<b>Aragi Shrine.</b>

22:02.190 --> 22:03.360
<b>It's said that the Mirror of Sky Fox</b>

22:03.440 --> 22:05.400
<b>can send celestial maidens
back to the heavens.</b>

22:06.070 --> 22:07.910
<b>I need to look into it.</b>
